&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Partner Account Manager - EMEA (L5-6)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location: EMEA (London, in office)&lt;br&gt;Experience: 8–12 years&lt;br&gt;Travel: 50%+&lt;br&gt;Reports To: Director, SI Partnerships&lt;br&gt;Focus: Strategic channel management and geo expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Sigma Partnerships team is hiring a Senior Partner Account Manager in our London office to support&amp;nbsp;Sigma&#39;s continued growth across EMEA. This role will strategically own a portfolio of System Integrator (SI)&amp;nbsp;Partners and will report to GTM leadership within the partner team. This role will drive the growth and&amp;nbsp;success of Sigma across EMEA and collaborate closely with sales and marketing teams to ensure success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sigma&#39;s SI partner ecosystem is growing rapidly, both globally and in the region, to meet rising demand for&amp;nbsp;professional services around Sigma and the Modern Data Stack. The ideal candidate brings a proven track&amp;nbsp;record managing partners, an established network of partner contacts across the EMEA data space, and&amp;nbsp;comfort operating in a high-growth, fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute GTM activities for a portfolio of SI partners across EMEA, growing both partner-sourced ACV and services revenue for our partners.&lt;/li&gt;
